ngside referenceImages, triggers the feedback-iteration flow.\",\"properties\":{\"improvements\":{\"description\":\"Findings to fix in the next iteration.\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"feature\":{\"description\":\"Short rubric label, e.g. 'face_clarity' or 'title_alignment'.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"message\":{\"description\":\"Human-readable explanation of this finding.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"pointImpact\":{\"description\":\"Point delta this finding contributed to the overall score (when available).\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"feature\",\"message\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"score\":{\"description\":\"Overall quality score (0–100) returned by the previous scoring call.\",\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"number\"},\"strengths\":{\"description\":\"Findings to preserve in the next iteration.\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"feature\":{\"description\":\"Short rubric label, e.g. 'face_clarity' or 'title_alignment'.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"message\":{\"description\":\"Human-readable explanation of this finding.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"pointImpact\":{\"description\":\"Point delta this finding contributed to the overall score (when available).\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"feature\",\"message\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"score\",\"strengths\",\"improvements\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"orientation\":{\"description\":\"Thumbnail orientation. 'landscape' is the standard 16:9 YouTube thumbnail (default when omitted); 'portrait' is a 9:16 Shorts thumbnail.\",\"enum\":[\"landscape\",\"portrait\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"referenceImages\":{\"description\":\"Reference thumbnails to emulate style/composition, hosted image URLs or uploaded images. Presence of this field switches the request out of Quick Generate into the Pro / Improve flow upstream. Capped at 10 entries; duplicates removed.\",\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"download_url\":{\"format\":\"uri\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"file_id\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"file_name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"mime_type\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"download_url\",\"file_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}]},\"maxItems\":10,\"type\":\"array\"},\"subjectImage\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"download_url\":{\"format\":\"uri\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"file_id\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"file_name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"mime_type\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"download_url\",\"file_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}],\"description\":\"A subject/person image, a hosted image URL or an uploaded image. Highest-priority likeness reference for the main face in the thumbnail.\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"Video title used for grounding. When omitted but videoId is provided, fetched from yt-proxy. Caller-supplied value wins.\",\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"transcript\":{\"description\":\"Optional transcript text. Used for subject detection in Quick Generate and as context in Pro Generate. Pair with vidiq_video_transcript when available.\",\"maxLength\":20000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"userQuery\":{\"description\":\"Natural-language creative direction (e.g. 'show the host pointing at a glowing dollar sign'). Highest-priority generation signal upstream.\",\"maxLength\":2000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoId\":{\"description\":\"YouTube video ID (e.g. 'dQw4w9WgXcQ'). When provided, title, description, and currentThumbnail are auto-filled from YouTube unless the caller supplies them explicitly. Optional when at least one of title, description, or userQuery is given.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
