{"step_index":45,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:34:49Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:04:49+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:04:50+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_generate_video.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 3590\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_generate_video\",\"description\":\"Generate a short video from a text prompt.\\n\\nPick a model (default sora-2), resolution and duration valid for that model, then describe the video in prompt. Optionally steer with an aspectRatio, seed image-to-video with startFrameB64/endFrameB64, or provide reference images via ingredients. startFrameB64/endFrameB64 and ingredients are mutually exclusive — use at most one.\\nIngredients (reference images) are supported on minimax-h3 and seedance-2 / seedance-2-fast (up to 9), veo-3.1 / veo-3.1-fast (up to 3, duration must be 8), and gemini-omni-flash (up to 3); other models reject them. Per-model durations/resolutions are validated by the server, which returns a specific error you can use to retry.\\nThis runs asynchronously: it returns an `mcpJobId` immediately — poll `vidiq_job_poll` with that id until it is \\\"completed\\\" to get the video URL. If generation fails, that poll refunds the credits.\\n\\nCredits are charged on submit and automatically refunded if generation fails.\\n\\nCost: scales with duration (seconds) × the model's per-second rate × 20 credits, quoted exactly at submit.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"aspectRatio\":{\"description\":\"Optional. Frame aspect ratio; defaults per-model when omitted.\",\"enum\":[\"9:16\",\"16:9\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"duration\":{\"description\":\"Clip length in seconds. Must be valid for the model — e.g. sora-2 → 4/8/12, veo-3.1 → 4/6/8, minimax-h3 → any 4–15, seedance-2 and seedance-2-fast → any 1–15.\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0,\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"endFrameB64\":{\"description\":\"Optional. Base64 last frame (JPEG/PNG/WebP, ≤10MB). Not supported for Sora models.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"ingredients\":{\"description\":\"Optional. Reference images (base64 or data-URI, ≤10MB each) to steer the result. Mutually exclusive with startFrameB64/endFrameB64. Per-model caps: minimax-h3 and seedance-2 / seedance-2-fast → up to 9 (JPEG/PNG/WebP); veo-3.1 / veo-3.1-fast → up to 3 (JPEG/PNG only, duration must be 8); gemini-omni-flash → up to 3; other models do not support ingredients.\",\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":9,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"},\"model\":{\"default\":\"sora-2\",\"description\":\"Generation model. Prefer minimax-h3 for compatible requests; use another model only when the requested duration, resolution, or capabilities require it. minimax-h3 → 768p/2k, 4–15s; seedance-2 → 720p/1080p, 1–15s; seedance-2-fast → 720p, 1–15s; veo-3.1 / veo-3.1-fast → 720p/1080p, 4/6/8s; sora-2 → 720p, 4/8/12s; gemini-omni-flash → 720p, any 3–10s (budget, audio included). seedance-1-5-pro is deprecated — use seedance-2 instead.\",\"enum\":[\"minimax-h3\",\"sora-2\",\"sora-2-pro\",\"veo-3.1\",\"veo-3.1-fast\",\"veo-3.1-lite\",\"kling-3\",\"kling-3-pro\",\"seedance-2\",\"seedance-2-fast\",\"seedance-1-5-pro\",\"gemini-omni-flash\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"prompt\":{\"description\":\"What the video should depict (1–4000 chars).\",\"maxLength\":4000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"resolution\":{\"description\":\"Output resolution. Must be valid for the chosen model — e.g. sora-2 → 720p, minimax-h3 → 768p or 2k; seedance-2 and veo-3.1 → 720p or 1080p (seedance-2-fast → 720p only).\",\"enum\":[\"720p\",\"768p\",\"1080p\",\"1024p\",\"2k\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"startFrameB64\":{\"description\":\"Optional. Base64 first frame for image-to-video (JPEG/PNG/WebP, ≤10MB). A data: prefix is stripped server-side.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"prompt\",\"resolution\",\"duration\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
