{"step_index":57,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:35:19Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:05:19+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:05:19+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_instagram_tiktok_outlier_search.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 3462\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_instagram_tiktok_outlier_search\",\"description\":\"Search Instagram Reels and TikTok videos together for posts that substantially outperform each creator's median. Results are returned in separate Instagram and TikTok sections because relevance scores are not comparable across platforms.\\n\\nUse `concept` for a complete content premise, `hook` for the first three seconds, or `format` for a subject-free production template. `audienceQuery` is a separate top-level audience rescore and must use: `Culture/Region: ...; Global: \\u003ctrue|false\\u003e; Demographics: ...;`.\\n\\nDefaults to the last 30 days, English captions, at least 10K views, one result per creator within each platform, and 5 results per platform. `resultsPerPlatform` controls each section independently. Use at least two outliers from a platform before calling something a pattern. Use `vidiq_ig_accounts_from_outliers` instead for Instagram account discovery.\\n\\nCost: 5 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"audienceQuery\":{\"description\":\"Required audience-rescore context as one string using `Culture/Region: ...; Global: \\u003ctrue|false\\u003e; Demographics: ...;`. Example: `Culture/Region: UK/British; Global: false; Demographics: working professional men 25-45, fat loss, busy lifestyle;`\",\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"collapseByCreator\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"datePostedAfter\":{\"format\":\"date-time\",\"pattern\":\"^(?:(?:\\\\d\\\\d[2468][048]|\\\\d\\\\d[13579][26]|\\\\d\\\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d(?::[0-5]\\\\d(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?)?(?:Z))$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"datePostedBefore\":{\"format\":\"date-time\",\"pattern\":\"^(?:(?:\\\\d\\\\d[2468][048]|\\\\d\\\\d[13579][26]|\\\\d\\\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\\\d(?::[0-5]\\\\d(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?)?(?:Z))$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"descriptionLanguage\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^[a-z]{2}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":20,\"type\":\"array\"},\"durationMax\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"number\"},\"durationMin\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"number\"},\"embeddingType\":{\"default\":\"concept\",\"enum\":[\"concept\",\"hook\",\"format\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"excludeContentIds\":{\"description\":\"Instagram reel shortcodes or TikTok video IDs to exclude.\",\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"type\":\"array\"},\"excludeCreatorHandles\":{\"description\":\"Creator handles to exclude from both platform searches, matched independently and without the leading @. Example: [\\\"creator_one\\\", \\\"creator.two\\\"].\",\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"type\":\"array\"},\"followersMax\":{\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"followersMin\":{\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"outlierScoreMax\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"number\"},\"outlierScoreMin\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"number\"},\"query\":{\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"resultsPerPlatform\":{\"default\":5,\"description\":\"Number of results to return from each platform.\",\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"viewsMax\":{\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"viewsMin\":{\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"query\",\"audienceQuery\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
