{"step_index":61,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:35:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:05:26+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:05:27+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_jobs_list.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 886\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_jobs_list\",\"description\":\"List your asynchronous vidIQ jobs, newest first.\\n\\nFilter by `toolName` and/or `status`. To find jobs that are still running,\\nfilter `status: 'inprogress'`. Use the returned `mcpJobId` with\\n`vidiq_job_poll` to check a job's result.\\n\\nThis tool is free.\\n\\nCost: 0 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"limit\":{\"default\":20,\"description\":\"Max jobs to return (1-50, default 20). Newest first.\",\"maximum\":50,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"status\":{\"description\":\"Filter by status. Omit for all. You usually want 'inprogress' to find jobs still running.\",\"enum\":[\"inprogress\",\"completed\",\"failed\",\"expired\",\"refunded\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"toolName\":{\"description\":\"Filter to jobs created by this tool (e.g. 'vidiq_generate_script').\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
