{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:35:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:05:53+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:05:53+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_outliers.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 5292\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_outliers\",\"description\":\"Find viral, breakout, and overperforming YouTube videos — videos getting significantly more views than their channel's average. Use this when someone asks for: viral videos, breakout hits, hidden gems, or videos blowing up. Use `keyword` to focus discovery on a topic, `channelIds` to focus on specific creators or competitors, or both to combine those constraints. For a general request that names neither a topic nor channels, the tool can return a broad outlier feed using the remaining filters and defaults. Filter requested content by the actual video-title `language`; `channelCountry` only filters where channels are based, not audience location or video language. For Polish-language outliers, pass `language='pl'`; `channelCountry='PL'` alone only restricts results to channels based in Poland. Returns a breakout score showing how much each video exceeds its channel's typical performance. For finding videos whose *thumbnails* look visually similar (by image or text description of the imagery), use vidiq_similar_thumbnails instead.\\n\\nCost: 5 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"channelCountry\":{\"description\":\"Restrict to channels BASED IN this country, as an ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code (e.g. \\\"PL\\\", \\\"US\\\"). This is where the channel/creator is located — NOT the audience/viewer country, and NOT the language of the videos. To search by the content language, use `language` instead. Example: for Polish-language outliers pass `language='pl'`; `channelCountry='PL'` alone only restricts to channels based in Poland (which may publish in any language).\",\"pattern\":\"^[A-Za-z]{2}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"channelIds\":{\"description\":\"Channel filter for focusing results on specific creators or competitors. Each entry may be a channel ID (UC...), a handle (@MrBeast or MrBeast), or a channel URL — handles and URLs are resolved to channel IDs automatically. May be combined with `keyword`.\",\"items\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"},\"contentType\":{\"default\":\"all\",\"description\":\"Filter by content type. Non-English title languages are available for long-form videos only, so language other than \\\"en\\\" requires contentType: \\\"long\\\".\",\"enum\":[\"all\",\"long\",\"short\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"keyword\":{\"description\":\"Topic filter for outlier video titles. Use it to focus results on a subject, and combine it with `channelIds` to search for that subject within selected channels.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"language\":{\"default\":\"en\",\"description\":\"Language of the video TITLE to search within, as a single ISO 639-1 code. Supported: en, es, ko, de, hi, ar, th, pl, it, ja, fr, tr, ru, pt, uk. When the user explicitly requests a language, always pass its code here. If the request does not specify a language, this tool defaults to language: \\\"en\\\" and searches English titles only. Non-English languages support long-form videos only and require contentType: \\\"long\\\"; Shorts and contentType: \\\"all\\\" support language: \\\"en\\\" only. For example: Spanish-language outliers → language: \\\"es\\\"; German breakout videos → language: \\\"de\\\"; \\\"видео на русском\\\" → language: \\\"ru\\\". Pass exactly one code (not a list); codes outside the supported set are rejected.\",\"enum\":[\"en\",\"es\",\"ko\",\"de\",\"hi\",\"ar\",\"th\",\"pl\",\"it\",\"ja\",\"fr\",\"tr\",\"ru\",\"pt\",\"uk\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"limit\":{\"default\":20,\"description\":\"Number of results to return\",\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"maxSubscribers\":{\"description\":\"Maximum channel subscribers\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"maxViews\":{\"description\":\"Maximum video views\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"minEngagementRate\":{\"description\":\"Minimum engagement rate\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"minOutlierScore\":{\"description\":\"Minimum outlier score\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"minSubscribers\":{\"description\":\"Minimum channel subscribers\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"minViews\":{\"description\":\"Minimum video views\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"minVph\":{\"description\":\"Minimum views per hour\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"publishedWithin\":{\"description\":\"Filter by publish date. For non-English languages, the effective window defaults to \\\"sixMonths\\\" and is capped there; English supports every listed range, including \\\"allTime\\\".\",\"enum\":[\"thisWeek\",\"thisMonth\",\"threeMonths\",\"sixMonths\",\"o